{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1089351-abyssals-in-3e","id":1089351,"title":"Abyssals in 3e","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-07T13:44:33-07:00","id":1089351,"title":"Abyssals in 3e","content":"Heya!<br /> <br /> I've been working on some Homebrew charms for the Abyssal Exalted in 3e and have around 20 archery charms completed. They're a first draft, but I'd appreciate some feedback. I don't particularly like the idea that Deathknights are just Solars in eye-shadow and so I've kept the 'Solar Mirror charms' to a minimum. I'd be really interested in what people think of them!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HwWbe1c5ET_z9YlkoRydwsdStQ4Uv2QWvWFRebz3mv8/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssal Archery Charms</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7J77B0MF_wEF673rHVeifKiDQVm3mQp1k5WWK0fEoQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssal Athletics Charms<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13409,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13409-klaymore","user":"Klaymore","date":".  Updated to add Athletics charms 05-12-2017, 07:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13409-klaymore","name":"Klaymore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T15:54:21-07:00","id":1089438,"title":"","content":"Are you aware that it has been said by the developers that Essence respiration will not change depending on where you're at?<br /> <br /> Solars in the Underworld or Abyssals in Creation will very probably respire normally.<br /> <br /> It was said that setting mote respiration to zero wasn't the way 3e was going to approach this, as being unable to use your powers just because of where you are (not a particular place but somewhere as broad as Creation or te Underworld) was just not fun.<br /> <br /> So when I read your Vampiric keyword I noticed that your Abyssals do not respire motes in Creation, and that might dampen people's interest a bit (or not, if they like the idea and think the devs are wrong, or if the new devs also dislike the idea).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-07T16:24:55-07:00","id":1089453,"title":"","content":"The new devs have also been on record as being members of the &quot;losing access to your cool powers sucks&quot; camp, per my inquiry re:the Fair Folk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T09:20:32-07:00","id":1089825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1089351-abyssals-in-3e?p=1089438#post1089438\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you aware that it has been said by the developers that Essence respiration will not change depending on where you're at?<br /> <br /> Solars in the Underworld or Abyssals in Creation will very probably respire normally.<br /> <br /> It was said that setting mote respiration to zero wasn't the way 3e was going to approach this, as being unable to use your powers just because of where you are (not a particular place but somewhere as broad as Creation or te Underworld) was just not fun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I had no idea that was the case. I've been trying to find any rules about Shadowlands in the Core book too, but to no avail. Removing the Vampiric keyword isn't as tedious as I had imagined it might be. I'll stick with the line the Dev's have foreseen as being the best for the game, assuming their vision for Creation will continue. Hopefully that will mean the most utility for these charms. <br /> <br /> thank you for pointing this out. The issue has been fixed by removing the Vampiric keyword entirly and allowing Abyssals to respire essence normally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13409-klaymore","name":"Klaymore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T09:29:02-07:00","id":1089829,"title":"","content":"I REALLY like Blizzard of Black Raitons, though I feel like it deserves a Willpower for creating a BG. A very cool expression of Abyssal power that's explicitly different from Solar power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T10:12:05-07:00","id":1089844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1089351-abyssals-in-3e?p=1089829#post1089829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I REALLY like Blizzard of Black Raitons, though I feel like it deserves a Willpower for creating a BG. A very cool expression of Abyssal power that's explicitly different from Solar power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you. I like it too. The image of a Deathknight shrouded in a swarm of Raitons just looks like an album cover in my mind )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13409-klaymore","name":"Klaymore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-12T14:19:34-07:00","id":1091703,"title":"","content":"I've been working on updating the Archery charms and making some athletics charms. I have 20 that I think are pretty cool... more mirrors of solar charms than I'm happy with if im honest, but they fit the Abyssal themes in my mind... so... here is the document. Feel free to comment or condemn. <br /> <br /> Terror's Wake Prana and Stumbling Rout of Terror were attempts to evoke the horror movie tropes of 'Faster than Run' walking that monsters do... Ten Thousand Bats Dance is perhaps my favourite charm in the cascade though. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7J77B0MF_wEF673rHVeifKiDQVm3mQp1k5WWK0fEoQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7J77B0MF_wEF673rHVeifKiDQVm3mQp1k5WWK0fEoQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7J77B0MF_wEF673rHVeifKiDQVm3mQp1k5WWK0fEoQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1U7J77B0MF_wEF673rHVeifKiDQVm3mQp1k5WWK0fEoQ/edit# </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13409-klaymore","name":"Klaymore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}